{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bostontourhub/items/333848/", "pk": 333848, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bostontourhub/", "pk": 26237, "shortname": "bostontourhub", "name": "WeVenture Boston", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Stories From the Freedom Trail", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 0, "unicode": "Stories From the Freedom Trail", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": true, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-midnight", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 6.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 0.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": true, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": -125, "description": "#Highlights\n\n* Take a wander around the city with a local guide and learn about the stories behind the historic landmarks dotted around the city.\n* Learn the history of the Boston Massacre and the part it played in the American Revolution.\n* Take in the modern and time-honored architecture of the downtown skyscrapers.\n* Walk past Beacon Hill and soak in views of the classic architecture and red brick row houses.\n* Enjoy the beautiful landscaping of Boston Public Garden.\n\n**Inclusions:** Local, English-speaking guide and a special Boston treat. \n\n**Exclusions:** Additional food and drink, souvenirs, tips and gratuities for the guide.\n_________________________\n#Summary\n\nThere’s so much more to Boston’s Freedom Trail than just the famous locations highlighted in every brochure and guidebook. Join a local guide to hear the tales and learn about the people that made Boston one of the most important cities in American history!  From the perspective of the Bostonians behind the infamous Boston Tea Party to the story of James Otis and his immortal line “No taxation without representation” at Faneuil Hall, you’ll be amazed at what your school history books didn’t tell you.  Hear about how an unknown artist influenced the story of the Boston Massacre and discover which of our Founding Fathers attended the very first public school in the country.  Your guide will fill you in on accounts of daily life for Revolution-era Bostonians, and what conditions were like for the British soldiers camping on Boston Common.Even enjoy a surprise local treat, so you’ll have plenty of energy to enjoy your time with us as we take you on a journey through the stories of the Freedom Trail!", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "#Check in Information \n\n______\n\nThis voucher is not necessary for you to join the tour, but it does have our contact information and the meeting location of your tour. We recommend that you save a copy of this email to your phone or print it out.\n\n- Your tour will meet at The Greenway Carousel (Outside - Next to the carousel entrance) 191 Atlantic Ave., Boston, MA 02111\n\n- If you are driving to the tour, please allow extra time to find parking.\n- This tour runs rain or shine, please dress appropriately for the weather.\n- If you need to reach us on the day of your tour, please call (617) 539-8271. \n\n**For more information about your tour:**\nVISIT: https://www.we-venture.com/boston/\nEMAIL: boston@we-venture.com", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "2 Hours | Go beyond the Freedom Trail!", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "